        "text": "theorem stream_divergence_zero (v w : E) (hΨ : ContDiffAt ℝ 2 Ψ p) (hk : DifferentiableAt ℝ k p.1) (hr : p.1 ≠ 0) : graphDivergence k v w (streamBeta w Ψ) (streamGamma k v Ψ) p = 0   -- docstring: \"The cylindrical divergence of the actual stream realization is exactly zero.\""
